{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_158_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c84fff76a744aede03b854e8f09dd04c15a2c7b9613f4242e99d1ca8a4e60eb", "ja": "ふたりとも、そこでストップ！", "zh": "你们两个，都停在那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_158_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aaaae0ad9e6ed03fdccddc8b53d23547812535d62c6dcb1f9efc9a7832847c3f", "ja": "近づかない方がいいよ……\n今のアタシには！", "zh": "你还是别靠近比较好……\n对现在的我来说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_158_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6adcb815043b0366ddf95e58a432b5e085b4009372d313b68697cbcc7655cbb", "ja": "いや、近づかないほうが\nいいって言われても……。\nヤッコ、何か知ってるか？", "zh": "就算你叫我别靠近……\n八惠，你知道些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_158_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "507ac96041239bab009596b36ae11f4635d12b26b7069a8f687593a9345dd67a", "ja": "わからないんですけど、歩さん、\n「プチ不幸が止まらない\n時期だから近づくな」って……。", "zh": "我也不太清楚，不过步小姐说\n“现在正处于小倒霉接连不断的\n时期，所以别靠近我”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_158_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_158_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b1d39710e6b5d8c951b1b7d4b3436fca1043de277dcba4e388fcd5c582343c1", "ja": "あー、だからダメだってば！\nアタシに近づいたら、ふたりにも\n不幸なコトが起こるんだって！", "zh": "啊——所以才说不行啦！\n要是靠近我的话，你们两个也会遇上不幸的事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
